---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="section story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="shell story-grid">
    <div class="story-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">The problem</p>
      <h2 id="story-title" class="section-title">Most pairing turns one of you into a guest</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="story-cards">
      <article class="story-card is-before reveal">
        <p class="card-label">
          <Icon name="clock-countdown" size={16} />
          Without Shadow
        </p>
        <p>Your mentor pings you: “hey, let’s pair on this bug.” They send a Live Share link.</p>
        <p class="muted">
          You have used WebStorm for three years. Now you are in VS Code for the first time since college.
          The terminal is somewhere else, the keybindings are wrong, your extensions are missing.
          Ten minutes go to getting oriented.
        </p>
        <p>The bug fix itself takes fifteen.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="story-card is-after reveal reveal-d1">
        <p class="card-label is-accent">
          <Icon name="check-circle" size={16} />
          With Shadow
        </p>
        <p>They click Start and paste the link. You open it in your Shadow app.</p>
        <p class="muted">
          You stay in WebStorm with your keymap. They stay in VS Code with theirs.
          Every save lands on both machines, and the relay in between only ever sees ciphertext.
        </p>
        <p>The bug fix takes fifteen minutes. Nothing else does.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: var(--sp-700);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .story-head {
    position: sticky;
    top: var(--sp-900);
  }

  .story-cards {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--sp-200);
  }

  .story-card {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--sp-200);
    padding: var(--sp-400);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--r-2xl);
    background: var(--surface);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: var(--lh-lg);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .story-card.is-after {
    border-color: var(--accent-line);
  }

  .story-card .muted {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .card-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--sp-75);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: var(--lh-xs);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .card-label.is-accent {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .story-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-500);
    }

    .story-head {
      position: static;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .story-card {
      padding: var(--sp-300);
      font-size: var(--text-base);
      line-height: var(--lh-base);
    }
  }
</style>
